{"id":"661502","name":"烤牛肉饼","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/661502/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"粉条","amount":"1把"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"400g"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉一块。","img":"images/661502/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"粉条泡软。","img":"images/661502/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛肉打成碎粒。","img":"images/661502/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入剁碎的粉条。","img":"images/661502/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入葱花和姜末。","img":"images/661502/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"浇入热油炝香。","img":"images/661502/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入盐、蚝油、酱油、五香粉、鸡精、胡椒粉调味。","img":"images/661502/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀，馅料就做好了。","img":"images/661502/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"克面粉加入200毫升清水和2克盐，和成面团。","img":"images/661502/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"面团里倒入10克食用油。","img":"images/661502/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再继续揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/661502/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/661502/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"取出面团。","img":"images/661502/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"面团搓成长条后，切成小剂子。","img":"images/661502/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"擀成面片，包入馅料，做成包子状。","img":"images/661502/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"翻面，用擀面杖轻轻擀成薄饼。","img":"images/661502/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"用划刀划成花纹。","img":"images/661502/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"碗内打入一个鸡蛋调成液。","img":"images/661502/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"表面刷蛋液。","img":"images/661502/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"入烤箱，180度25分钟。","img":"images/661502/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"时间到出炉。","img":"images/661502/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661502/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661502/step_23.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}